Third-party assets
==================

assets/place-pin.png and assets/place-pin-hdpi.png
--------------------------------------------------

These PNG files are derived from Google Maps `spotlight_pin_v4` artwork
(outline, fill, and center-dot layers). They are recolored and composited
at build time (see scripts/bake-place-pin.js) so the extension overlay can
show a Places teardrop that matches the native Google Maps pin appearance.

They are used only inside Google Maps pages served by this extension.
They do not represent this project as an official Google product.

